<title>UK: Arjo Wiggins 1996 turnover little changed.</title>
<headline>Arjo Wiggins 1996 turnover little changed.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British paper and packaging group Arjo Wiggins Appleton Plc said on Tuesday that turnover for the year ended December 31, 1996 was 3.57 billion stg, little changed from figures for 1995.  </p>
<p>Turnover at the group in 1995 was 3.57 billion stg.</p>
<p>Fourth quarter turnover at the firm decreased 4.7 percent to 874.9 million stg compared with the same quarter in 1995.</p>
<p>Under its listing requirements, Arjo is required to disclose its quarterly turnover figures to the Paris Bourse.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
